bucket/zipball/v3.2.0","body":"## What's Changed\r\n* chore: Central go-version for GitHub actions by @jhillyerd in https://github.com/inbucket/inbucket/pull/591\r\n* build(deps): bump goreleaser/goreleaser-action from 6 to 7 by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/inbucket/inbucket/pull/594\r\n* build(deps): bump minimatch from 3.1.2 to 3.1.5 in /ui by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/inbucket/inbucket/pull/595\r\n* build(deps): bump svgo from 2.8.0 to 2.8.2 in /ui by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/inbucket/inbucket/pull/596\r\n* Revert \"build(deps): bump svgo from 2.8.0 to 2.8.2 in /ui (#596)\" by @jhillyerd in https://github.com/inbucket/inbucket/pull/597\r\n* fix(nix): use top-level node-gyp/yarn and nodejs_22 in shell.nix by @jhillyerd in https://github.com/inbucket/inbucket/pull/606\r\n* build(deps): bump docker/setup-qemu-action from 3 to 4 by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/inbucket/inbucket/pull/602\r\n* build(deps): bump docker/setup-buildx-action from 3 to 4 by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/inbucket/inbucket/pull/598\r\n* build(deps): bump docker/metadata-action from 5 to 6 by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/inbucket/inbucket/pull/599\r\n* build(deps): bump docker/login-action from 3 to 4 by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/inbucket/inbucket/pull/600\r\n* build(deps): bump docker/build-push-action from 6 to 7 by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/inbucket/inbucket/pull/601\r\n* build(deps): bump picomatch from 2.3.1 to 2.3.2 in /ui by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/inbucket/inbucket/pull/603\r\n* build(deps): bump lodash from 4.17.21 to 4.18.1 in /ui by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/inbucket/inbucket/pull/604\r\n* build(deps): bump actions/checkout from 6 to 7 by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/inbucket/inbucket/pull/612\r\n* build(deps): bump actions/setup-node from 6 to 7 by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/inbucket/inbucket/pull/613\r\n* build(deps): bump actions/setup-go from 6 to 7 by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/inbucket/inbucket/pull/614\r\n* bump go deps by @jhillyerd in https://github.com/inbucket/inbucket/pull/615\r\n* fix: swaks file syntax in tests, log header parse failures by @jhillyerd in https://github.com/inbucket/inbucket/pull/616\r\n* bump ui deps by @jhillyerd in https://github.com/inbucket/inbucket/pull/617\r\n* test(pop3): add black-box transaction state tests by @jhillyerd in https://github.com/inbucket/inbucket/pull/618\r\n* refactor(pop3): extract transaction handler helpers by @jhillyerd in https://github.com/inbucket/inbucket/pull/619\r\n* fix(pop3): reject deleted messages and failed TLS handshakes by @jhillyerd in https://github.com/inbucket/inbucket/pull/620\r\n* test(rest): add black-box WebSocket monitor tests by @jhillyerd in https://github.com/inbucket/inbucket/pull/621\r\n* refactor(rest): deduplicate WebSocket monitor controllers by @jhillyerd in https://github.com/inbucket/inbucket/pull/622\r\n* fix(rest): make WebSocket monitor listener teardown safe under concurrency by @jhillyerd in https://github.com/inbucket/inbucket/pull/623\r\n* fix(pop3): track STLS state per session instead of per server by @antoinedeschenes in https://github.com/inbucket/inbucket/pull/626\r\n* feat: reload TLS certificates when their files change by @antoinedeschenes in https://github.com/inbucket/inbucket/pull/625\r\n* test(policy): cover origin parsing and accept/store policy dispatch by @jhillyerd in https://github.com/inbucket/inbucket/pull/624\r\n* deps: bump indirect dependencies to latest compatible releases by @hillyerd-bot in https://github.com/inbucket/inbucket/pull/631\r\n* chore: release 3.2.0 by @hillyerd-bot in https://github.com/inbucket/inbucket/pull/632\r\n\r\n## New Contributors\r\n* @antoinedeschenes made their first contribution in https://github.com/inbucket/inbucket/pull/626\r\n* @hillyerd-bot made their first contribution in https://github.com/inbucket/inbucket/pull/631\r\n\r\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/inbucket/inbucket/compare/v3.1.1...v3.2.0","mentions_count":4}